data: {"id": "fad5158a9817431f-thinking-parallel_evidence-234", "run_id": "fad5158a9817431f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，让我先执行首轮核心工具获取 Kubernetes 事实，同时基于已有可观测性结果进行初步分析。\n\n## 已有可观测性结果分析\n\n1. **Metrics (Prometheus)**: ✅ present - `kube_pod_status_phase` 返回 `Pending=1`，确认 Pod 当前处于 Pending 状态。UID=`c54b3bab-76ec-47fa-934e-04a8b48cae1a`。\n2. **Logging (Elasticsearch)**: ❌ error - 权限不足 (`Forbidden`)，无法查询 ES，这是工具层面限制，不是 Pod 无日志。\n3. **Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo)**: ✅ empty - `pod_ip is empty`，因为 Pod 未运行，没有分配 IP，DeepFlow 无法查询流量是预期行为。\n4. **Topology**: 尚未执行，将在下方执行。\n\n现在并行执行 Kubernetes 核心查询和 Topology：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788407455043, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

