data: {"id": "fad5158a9817431f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1647", "run_id": "fad5158a9817431f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**已采集事实：**\n\n1. **`query_pod_logs` 失败原因**：这是后端 Elasticsearch 连接组件 `monitor/elasticsearch-master-0` 的权限问题（`system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager` 无法在 `monitor` 命名空间创建 `pods/exec`）。这不是 `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 的参数错误，而是日志检索基础设施的 Forbidden 错误。**无法通过修正参数恢复**——这是 MCP Server 服务账号权限缺失。\n\n2. **Pod 真实状态**（kubectl 事实）：\n   - **状态：Pending**，`node: <none>` — 未被调度到任何节点\n   - **根因事件**：`FailedScheduling` — `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n   - **NodeSelector**：`aiops.lab", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788407479331, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

